@startuml
title One fold: half the notebook, half the rule
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F3EEFB
  BorderColor #7A5BB5
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F3EEFB
  DiamondBorderColor #7A5BB5
}
skinparam ArrowColor #7A5BB5

start
:Rule with 4 numbers:  2 + 3x + 5x^2 + 4x^3
Notebook with N lines (each spot x has a twin -x);
:Split into halves
  even half:  2 + 5y       (y = x^2)
  odd half:   3 + 4y;
:Inspector rolls a number, say 10;
:Blend:  (2 + 5y) + 10 x (3 + 4y) = 32 + 45y;
:Folded notebook: N / 2 lines (one per y = x^2)
Folded rule: 2 numbers instead of 4;
if (Was the old notebook clean?) then (yes)
  :Folded notebook is clean, for any roll;<<#F3EEFB>>
else (no, it was far from every rule)
  :Folded notebook is still far, for almost every roll;<<#FDEEEE>>
endif
:Repeat until the notebook is short enough to read in full;
stop
@enduml
